WEBVTT

00:20.860 --> 00:23.250
Kill me? Kill me.

00:37.000 --> 00:39.260
Sh-Sh-Shion-dono—

00:38.460 --> 00:39.260
Nurugai.

00:39.260 --> 00:41.790
Cut their flowers and roots with your sword.

00:41.790 --> 00:44.020
That may slow their transformation.

00:44.990 --> 00:46.750
Then take the others and get away from here.

00:46.750 --> 00:47.520
Got it.

00:50.370 --> 00:51.780
Shion-dono.

00:51.980 --> 00:54.400
We'll talk later. This will be over soon.

00:54.990 --> 00:58.510
The movement, smell, 
and sound of these waves.

00:59.240 --> 01:00.210
No doubt about it.

01:00.750 --> 01:02.410
It's the same as the creature 
that killed Tenza.

01:03.200 --> 01:06.700
On the way here, I took 
the lives of various creatures

01:06.700 --> 01:08.920
to test the usage and nature of the waves.

01:08.920 --> 01:13.920
Now I will use you to demonstrate 
how the immortal can be killed.

01:14.560 --> 01:17.840
<i>Cutting the waves directly will kill a 
creature, even if the vitals aren't struck,</i>

01:17.840 --> 01:20.350
<i>as it is akin to cutting the soul itself.</i>

01:20.680 --> 01:25.850
<i>I will release, circulate, 
and envelop myself in my own waves.</i>

03:07.640 --> 03:12.640
<b>Dreams and Reality</b>

03:09.780 --> 03:13.240
The flowers have stopped growing, 
but at this rate...

03:14.630 --> 03:16.850
Hoko-san, what should we do?

03:16.850 --> 03:19.210
There is nothing I can do for him.

03:19.210 --> 03:23.500
I did not even know what 
the Tensen actually were.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.740
Move, both of you.

03:27.440 --> 03:28.860
It may be too late for him,

03:28.860 --> 03:30.940
but I have a salve 
that will stop the bleeding.

03:30.940 --> 03:33.510
Yuzuriha-san...

03:34.360 --> 03:36.360
It's too late for me...

03:38.120 --> 03:39.360
Shion-dono!

03:39.550 --> 03:41.480
Don't worry about him.

03:41.480 --> 03:43.860
He's really strong. Besides,

03:43.860 --> 03:46.370
we followed a certain creature here.

03:46.720 --> 03:49.310
He won't die here.

03:50.080 --> 03:52.670
Tameshi Itto-ryu: Fiend's Flurry.

03:55.080 --> 03:57.920
Tameshi Itto-ryu: Autumn Rains.

04:23.610 --> 04:26.250
What's his deal? He's incredible.

04:26.250 --> 04:27.490
He's my master.

04:28.490 --> 04:30.830
<i>It's not regenerating.</i>

04:30.830 --> 04:34.000
<i>Shion's tao is compatible with the enemy's.</i>

04:34.430 --> 04:35.420
Perhaps...

04:38.460 --> 04:40.420
It's mostly consistent with my tests.

04:42.670 --> 04:45.430
Incredible. Yours 
is opposed to mine as well.

04:45.760 --> 04:46.430
But...

04:52.030 --> 04:54.540
Even scratches will produce flowers.

04:55.810 --> 04:57.940
You'll make good tan.

04:57.940 --> 04:59.190
Master!

05:05.090 --> 05:07.900
Do you want to die, too?

05:11.820 --> 05:13.750
I don't intend to die here.

05:14.000 --> 05:17.880
But if I can't progress without dying, 
then I accept death.

05:18.100 --> 05:21.100
What's up with him? He's horrifying.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.760
He's losing too much blood.

05:23.150 --> 05:24.370
Master...

05:25.980 --> 05:28.360
Kill! Kill me.

05:29.360 --> 05:34.020
<i>I'm using my waves as I tested, 
but it's still no simple task.</i>

05:34.640 --> 05:38.520
<i>Can my body withstand what it takes 
to kill an immortal creature?</i>

05:38.950 --> 05:40.500
I need to help him.

05:41.010 --> 05:42.900
Don't. You can barely stand.

05:43.450 --> 05:45.590
But at this rate...

05:46.000 --> 05:49.410
No, Shion-dono is already prepared to die.

05:49.410 --> 05:51.910
Fighting alone is too great a disadvantage.

05:51.910 --> 05:55.150
We should at least attack 
from two sides to create an opening.

05:55.500 --> 05:58.100
Fine. In that case, let's all—

05:58.100 --> 05:59.570
What?

05:59.570 --> 06:03.420
No, thanks. I'm all out of steam.

06:03.820 --> 06:04.920
I see.

06:09.400 --> 06:10.590
Better now?

06:10.590 --> 06:11.680
What do you mean?

06:12.030 --> 06:13.730
That's odd.

06:17.230 --> 06:18.310
Better now?

06:19.940 --> 06:23.010
I feel... slightly more energized?

06:23.440 --> 06:24.780
Better now?

06:24.780 --> 06:26.950
Huh? Uh, I suppose.

06:26.950 --> 06:28.700
But how...?

06:28.700 --> 06:30.700
I used to do it to Grandpa all the time.

06:30.950 --> 06:34.700
When I did it to my master, 
he said it energized him, too.

06:35.080 --> 06:37.700
I've clearly recovered some stamina.

06:38.090 --> 06:40.630
All creatures produce waves,

06:40.630 --> 06:45.460
but there must be various interactions, 
like the elements of Wuxing philosophy.

06:45.950 --> 06:48.120
But I'd prefer you not 
suddenly latch onto me.

06:48.120 --> 06:50.440
Simply touching me seems 
to have some effect.

06:50.440 --> 06:51.720
Okay.

06:51.990 --> 06:54.010
<i>Which means sometimes there are 
positive interactions,</i>

06:54.010 --> 06:56.220
<i>such as increasing someone's tao.</i>

06:56.220 --> 06:59.350
<i>No, there's no time to think right now.</i>

07:00.480 --> 07:02.480
<i>As long as I can move, that's good enough.</i>

07:02.480 --> 07:03.670
Let's go.

07:03.670 --> 07:05.230
Good luck.

07:08.630 --> 07:11.990
Sagiri, Nurugai. I told you to stay away.

07:12.390 --> 07:15.090
Wait, what are you wearing?

07:15.090 --> 07:16.990
We'll help you, Shion-dono.

07:16.990 --> 07:19.380
I know the creature's weakness.

07:19.380 --> 07:20.250
Its weakness?

07:20.250 --> 07:22.890
The source of its power. The tanden.

07:23.380 --> 07:25.260
If we can strike at its core, 
we should be able to defeat it.

07:28.230 --> 07:31.360
But that monster has two tanden.

07:31.360 --> 07:34.390
Simply being scratched by it is fatal.

07:34.390 --> 07:36.580
That's what this is for.

07:36.890 --> 07:40.390
We've wrapped ourselves in bandages 
and Yuzuriha's mucus.

07:40.780 --> 07:44.220
It should be able to prevent scratches 
and keep flowers from growing.

07:44.220 --> 07:46.000
Is it really necessary to lick it?

07:46.000 --> 07:46.960
No.

07:47.790 --> 07:51.150
This child and I will act as decoys 
and attack from the front.

07:51.440 --> 07:53.680
Use that opportunity to get behind it.

07:53.680 --> 07:56.660
With your speed, you should be 
able to strike two places at once.

07:58.080 --> 07:59.170
Watch out!

08:05.630 --> 08:07.520
<i>Such an athletic child...</i>

08:13.390 --> 08:14.840
Wow.

08:15.120 --> 08:18.100
<i>Incredible. Sagiri's sensing its waves, too.</i>

08:18.910 --> 08:22.600
<i>Like me, she's predicting its movements 
from the flow of its waves,</i>

08:22.930 --> 08:25.350
<i>and doing it even faster
and more accurately than I can.</i>

08:26.480 --> 08:27.830
<i>You've become so strong.</i>

08:29.560 --> 08:30.320
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

08:30.640 --> 08:32.710
We'll go with your plan, Sagiri.

08:32.710 --> 08:34.560
Let's play it by ear.

08:34.560 --> 08:35.240
Got it.

08:37.250 --> 08:40.650
<i>Tameshi Itto-ryu: Harvest Shower.</i>

09:14.250 --> 09:16.990
Wow, they're actually overpowering it.

09:20.100 --> 09:23.370
<i>It's taking longer and longer to regenerate.</i>

09:25.950 --> 09:28.910
I've never seen Shion-dono 
fight so fiercely before.

09:29.340 --> 09:31.340
We could actually beat it.

09:34.010 --> 09:36.260
I'll keep this up...

09:36.980 --> 09:40.330
even if I die here.

09:51.440 --> 09:54.110
<i>I'm sorry, Sagiri, Nurugai.</i>

09:54.110 --> 09:56.860
<i>I knew it would be dangerous.</i>

09:56.860 --> 09:59.910
<i>But I can't stop.</i>

10:00.240 --> 10:05.250
<i>My mind and body are being 
swallowed by a pitch-black emotion.</i>

10:05.250 --> 10:07.770
<i>It's not resolve. It's hatred.</i>

10:08.470 --> 10:12.500
<i>My hatred and frustration will never forgive</i>

10:12.910 --> 10:16.800
<i>how all I could do 
in that moment was run away.</i>

10:20.510 --> 10:24.790
Never forgive. Never, never, never!

10:24.790 --> 10:28.600
<i>Yamada Asaemon Shion, 
you will never be forgiven.</i>

10:28.600 --> 10:31.130
<i>Not until the life of the enemy has ended.</i>

10:31.130 --> 10:33.980
<i>Not until your own life has ended.</i>

10:39.740 --> 10:41.270
Shion-dono!

10:42.170 --> 10:45.500
<i>I'll gather all the waves flowing 
through my body in a single point.</i>

10:46.000 --> 10:50.080
<i>I'll temper them and 
wrap them around my blade.</i>

10:50.960 --> 10:54.170
Focusing one's waves is 
the same as focusing one's soul.

10:54.730 --> 10:56.930
If you're not careful, you risk dying.

10:57.900 --> 11:00.450
But if you're immortal, 
then allow me to teach you

11:01.280 --> 11:04.460
how fleeting and heavy life is.

11:05.720 --> 11:07.100
How terrifying it is!

11:08.350 --> 11:11.850
<i>Wait. Is this truly its weakness?</i>

11:11.850 --> 11:15.090
<i>According to Sagiri, 
it's the source of its power.</i>

11:15.090 --> 11:17.730
<i>But I don't sense strong 
waves coming from here.</i>

11:20.600 --> 11:21.800
<i>There's no time to hesitate—</i>

11:21.800 --> 11:23.240
Shion-san!

11:23.240 --> 11:24.370
The ovule!

11:24.370 --> 11:25.630
Senta!

11:26.620 --> 11:34.080
If it's a plant monster, 
then its ovule is its tanden.

11:34.500 --> 11:37.900
Where the nutrients 
for its flowers are concentrated.

11:38.550 --> 11:40.820
At the center of its petals.

11:42.300 --> 11:44.720
That's its weakness!

11:58.530 --> 12:00.280
Beautiful.

12:00.550 --> 12:02.510
A man prepared to die.

12:02.510 --> 12:04.720
The space between life and death.

12:04.720 --> 12:09.410
I could never attain such perfect yin-yang.

12:09.710 --> 12:12.400
I wish I could've shown Rien.

12:21.880 --> 12:25.760
I waited a thousand years. Thank you.

12:55.640 --> 12:56.690
Senta-dono!

12:59.670 --> 13:01.640
He'll live another half-hour at most.

13:01.640 --> 13:03.510
That took everything he had left.

13:03.510 --> 13:04.720
No...

13:05.090 --> 13:05.860
Senta!

13:05.860 --> 13:07.340
Don't move, Master.

13:07.690 --> 13:08.920
What about the salve?

13:09.430 --> 13:11.200
I still have one dose left.

13:11.200 --> 13:12.100
Th-Then...

13:14.780 --> 13:17.600
I think it'd be better used on him.

13:18.670 --> 13:21.040
If you split the dose, then...

13:21.040 --> 13:23.000
I need to keep some for myself.

13:23.000 --> 13:25.740
I'm not such a good person 
that I'd give all of it away.

13:26.110 --> 13:29.490
Besides, the road ahead is too difficult 
to bring an injured man with us.

13:29.970 --> 13:30.960
Give up.

13:32.470 --> 13:35.710
No... but...

13:36.260 --> 13:40.340
Didn't you say we'd manage 
somehow as long as we were alive?

13:40.340 --> 13:42.340
Shinobi are realists.

13:42.610 --> 13:44.340
We can tell the difference between suffering

13:44.340 --> 13:47.590
that should be overcome 
and suffering that's pointless to endure.

13:50.000 --> 13:54.140
I'm sure you know this, 
but you're not going to make it.

13:54.140 --> 13:55.700
So you can let go.

13:56.590 --> 14:01.240
You don't need to hold onto 
your job or pride anymore.

14:01.930 --> 14:03.280
You can relax now.

14:04.800 --> 14:07.750
You've always lied to yourself, right?

14:07.750 --> 14:12.150
At the very end, think about 
whatever you want to think about.

14:13.680 --> 14:16.400
Your family? A pet cat?

14:16.400 --> 14:18.790
A sweetheart you left back home?

14:18.790 --> 14:24.490
Picture them in your heart as you 
die beholding a beautiful sight.

14:25.050 --> 14:27.150
I can at least let you lean on me.

14:29.370 --> 14:30.780
The things I loved...

14:30.780 --> 14:33.440
My family back home. Konpeito.

14:34.210 --> 14:36.290
Kitao Shigemasa's illustrated books.

14:37.070 --> 14:40.760
Being in the arms of the one I admired.

14:52.390 --> 14:55.540
The situation has progressed too quickly.

14:55.540 --> 14:57.500
I'd like to take stock of things.

14:57.760 --> 14:58.980
I agree.

14:58.980 --> 15:01.120
Let's start with who the heck you two are.

15:02.190 --> 15:05.000
Let's get away from here first, Sagiri.

15:12.320 --> 15:15.540
Thank you for what you 
said earlier, Yuzuriha-san.

15:16.030 --> 15:18.640
Your cool head saved me again.

15:22.890 --> 15:26.120
It no longer matters if we're criminals 
or executioners anymore.

15:26.120 --> 15:28.030
We won't survive otherwise.

15:28.530 --> 15:32.160
Let's focus all our efforts 
on making it back alive.

15:35.760 --> 15:37.540
I won't let anyone else die.

15:38.080 --> 15:40.500
I swear we'll all leave this island alive.

15:41.790 --> 15:42.880
I swear it.

15:53.090 --> 15:55.500
That's the first thing 
you do upon waking up?

15:55.500 --> 15:58.200
Relax a little. What are you, a cat?

15:58.750 --> 15:59.770
Where are we?

16:00.010 --> 16:02.770
A cave halfway up the valley wall.

16:02.770 --> 16:05.270
I carried you here.

16:05.990 --> 16:07.210
<i>I can't remember...</i>

16:32.270 --> 16:36.130
This place should allow us 
to hide for a while.

16:36.130 --> 16:38.340
Of course, we'll need to be careful.

16:39.700 --> 16:41.610
What are you doing?

16:41.610 --> 16:42.700
Changing.

16:45.460 --> 16:47.200
I bet this would look good on you, Sagirin.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.560
Me, too.

16:48.560 --> 16:50.360
Why would a guy wear this?

16:50.760 --> 16:52.480
Why, you...

16:52.090 --> 16:53.490
Keep your wits about you.

16:52.480 --> 16:54.700
What's your problem?

16:53.770 --> 16:56.590
Sagiri, I understand your eagerness,

16:54.700 --> 16:55.810
I wanna wear it, too.

16:55.810 --> 16:56.590
You do?

16:56.590 --> 16:56.960
Yeah.

16:56.590 --> 16:59.280
but you must be exhausted as well.

16:56.960 --> 16:57.640
Really? Which one?

16:57.640 --> 16:58.410
This one.

16:58.410 --> 16:59.280
That one?

16:59.280 --> 16:59.600
Yeah.

16:59.280 --> 17:02.180
Relaxing a little won't hurt you.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.850
Wouldn't this look better?

17:00.850 --> 17:02.180
No, I want this one.

17:02.180 --> 17:03.500
This one?

17:02.180 --> 17:03.500
Shion-dono.

17:03.500 --> 17:04.140
Yeah, this one.

17:04.140 --> 17:04.980
Well, try it on, then.

17:04.980 --> 17:06.000
Okay, everyone.

17:06.590 --> 17:09.120
Don't stop what you're doing, 
but listen while you do that.

17:09.120 --> 17:10.250
Okay.

17:10.630 --> 17:14.720
Let's focus on reviewing what information 
we have that will help us return alive.

17:15.430 --> 17:18.290
First, let's discuss the waves needed 
to defeat the Tensen.

17:18.290 --> 17:20.260
What you call tao.

17:21.120 --> 17:23.270
It's a power everyone possesses innately,

17:23.270 --> 17:26.670
but mastering it allows one 
to achieve superhuman abilities.

17:27.650 --> 17:30.040
Isn't that what you do, Sagiri?

17:30.630 --> 17:33.350
Your experiences on the island 
have strengthened your tao.

17:34.190 --> 17:36.400
It must've been hard.

17:36.400 --> 17:39.160
No worse than it was for you.

17:39.700 --> 17:41.610
But you must be careful how you use it.

17:41.610 --> 17:43.710
Tao is life itself.

17:44.240 --> 17:46.790
Use too much, and you'll exhaust 
more than just your stamina.

17:47.740 --> 17:50.290
It's unclear exactly what the effects are,

17:50.290 --> 17:52.960
but it might cause mental 
or physical changes.

17:53.370 --> 17:57.220
It might even affect one's 
consciousness or memories.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.550
In the worst case, 
overuse likely leads to death.

17:59.970 --> 18:02.790
If we're talking about life or death,

18:02.790 --> 18:05.090
then we've got a more serious problem.

18:05.600 --> 18:07.730
The Elixir of Life.

18:07.730 --> 18:11.730
Though there's something similar, 
there's no Elixir of Life.

18:11.730 --> 18:15.410
The Shogunate won't accept 
"we couldn't find it."

18:15.410 --> 18:17.860
Gabimaru said it exists.

18:18.110 --> 18:20.470
His village chief was immortal.

18:20.470 --> 18:22.800
It must exist somewhere.

18:25.120 --> 18:27.250
About that...

18:27.540 --> 18:29.500
Maybe that was an illusion.

18:30.480 --> 18:33.130
An... illusion?

18:33.130 --> 18:36.010
Yeah, the type shinobi use.

18:36.370 --> 18:39.040
Show someone a supernatural phenomenon

18:39.040 --> 18:41.770
when they're little to 
achieve total control over them.

18:42.760 --> 18:45.770
You imprint on people 
that they can never defy the chief.

18:46.590 --> 18:49.310
Only a few leaders know the truth.

18:49.310 --> 18:50.890
The same thing happened in my village.

18:51.290 --> 18:52.020
What?

18:52.490 --> 18:55.680
I've got other questions, too.

18:55.680 --> 19:00.710
Sagirin, you said Gabimaru's here 
for the person he loves.

19:00.710 --> 19:02.660
Yes, his wife.

19:02.660 --> 19:05.900
Yeah, that. It doesn't make sense.

19:05.900 --> 19:07.360
Shinobi are merely pawns.

19:07.360 --> 19:11.670
It's different for women, but would they 
really have such a young man get married?

19:12.010 --> 19:16.130
You can't control people using only fear.

19:16.130 --> 19:20.130
They need something stronger to motivate 
them to complete suicidal missions.

19:20.680 --> 19:22.330
I'm just speculating, though.

19:20.680 --> 19:23.820
Wait a minute.

19:22.330 --> 19:25.000
His village could be different from mine.

19:25.420 --> 19:26.800
But...

19:26.800 --> 19:30.500
<i>I can't remember. Is it some 
type of memory impairment?</i>

19:31.360 --> 19:33.920
But Gabimaru's... wife, was it?

19:34.560 --> 19:36.980
Does she actually exist?

19:36.980 --> 19:38.990
Wait.

19:38.990 --> 19:39.990
What's her name?

19:40.740 --> 19:42.750
Have you actually seen her?

19:41.700 --> 19:42.490
Please...

19:43.490 --> 19:45.690
Maybe that's the chief's special illusion.

19:46.280 --> 19:49.910
Do you even remember what she looks like?

19:51.470 --> 19:52.540
<i>It's no use.</i>

19:52.790 --> 19:54.560
<i>I can't even remember where I am.</i>

19:54.560 --> 19:55.760
<i>Why am I here?</i>

19:56.290 --> 19:57.670
<i>Who are these guys?</i>

19:57.670 --> 20:00.170
<i>Enemies? Doesn't seem like it.</i>

20:00.370 --> 20:01.990
<i>I know who I am.</i>

20:02.690 --> 20:03.800
<i>I am...</i>

20:04.410 --> 20:08.310
<i>Iwagakure's current greatest ninja, 
Gabimaru the Hollow.</i>

20:08.880 --> 20:12.450
<i>In any case, I'll have to gather 
information while playing along.</i>

20:13.660 --> 20:15.310
<i>Even if they figure me out...</i>

20:18.820 --> 20:21.570
Gabimaru, okay?

20:21.880 --> 20:24.320
Yeah, I'm fine.

20:36.180 --> 20:37.830
You're not going to sleep, Sagiri?

20:39.410 --> 20:41.340
Shion-dono.

20:42.300 --> 20:44.610
Why are you dressed like that?

20:44.610 --> 20:46.800
My clothes were bloody, so I changed.

20:47.280 --> 20:48.930
I looked an awful mess.

20:50.700 --> 20:51.740
What's this?

20:51.740 --> 20:54.320
Normally you appreciate my jokes.

20:54.320 --> 20:56.050
Was it not good?

20:56.050 --> 20:58.290
No, your wit is as sharp as ever.

20:58.290 --> 21:01.670
But right now, I simply can't...

21:02.960 --> 21:09.640
Eizen-dono, Genji-dono, Senta-dono, 
Kisho-dono, and Tenza-dono...

21:09.640 --> 21:14.170
So much has happened, but it's 
still only our third night here.

21:15.450 --> 21:16.720
Then there's Gabimaru.

21:17.180 --> 21:18.870
What is he doing now?

21:19.740 --> 21:20.970
Sagiri...

21:21.550 --> 21:22.340
Don't tell me you love—

21:22.340 --> 21:23.480
Not at all.

21:23.480 --> 21:26.220
The way you always assume things 
are romantic is a bad habit of yours.

21:26.220 --> 21:27.010
Sorry.

21:27.470 --> 21:29.940
But it's clear that you 
feel strongly about him.

21:29.940 --> 21:31.870
Beyond what's appropriate for your status.

21:32.540 --> 21:35.770
What are you to Gabimaru?

21:37.030 --> 21:40.720
Honestly, I don't know, but...

21:41.750 --> 21:45.570
Born in a village of killers, 
he killed as he was told.

21:46.090 --> 21:49.780
He's experienced love, 
but it makes his past self suffer.

21:50.240 --> 21:53.440
On top of that, like Yuzuriha-san said,

21:53.440 --> 21:56.160
if what motivates him is 
a deception as well...

21:56.470 --> 21:59.670
That's simply too sad.

22:00.860 --> 22:03.150
He's a heinous killer.

22:03.150 --> 22:06.800
He's a killer, but I don't 
believe he's a bad person.

22:06.800 --> 22:07.930
Which is why...

22:09.360 --> 22:11.760
I believe they'll be reunited.

22:12.180 --> 22:15.230
He'll never give up.

22:16.010 --> 22:17.510
He'll make it back alive.

24:05.590 --> 24:08.550
I'll now read the message 
the Shogun sent to us.

24:08.810 --> 24:09.920
Listen carefully.

24:10.830 --> 24:13.980
The Yamada clan shall head once more to

24:13.980 --> 24:16.800
Shinsenkyo to monitor 
the expedition members.

24:17.150 --> 24:19.560
You are to select new monitors for this job,

24:19.900 --> 24:21.940
Yamada Asaemon Shugen.
